#1. commands
==================

podman build -t stress-tester .
podman run -p127.0.0.1:8080:8080 -p127.0.0.1:8181:8181 --net mq-bridge --name ansh-stress-tester --replace localhost/stress-tester:latest
podman exec -it ansh-stress-tester sh


to allow network between containers there are three solutions

1- solution add to run command (not recommended)
--add-host=host.containers.internal:allowed

2- solution to ctreate a network bridge
   a- podman network create mq-bridge
   b- podman network connect mq-bridge my-ibm-mq
   c- use it in podman run command --net mq-bridge  in both containers

3- use docker-compose.yml file

finally use container name like my-ibm-mq(1414)
